WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.956
"I have to get to Metro City Plumbing Supply," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:16.957 --> 00:00:21.335
"Mr. Copper has disappeared!"

3
00:00:21.336 --> 00:00:23.970
Roxy popped her head into the classroom.

4
00:00:23.971 --> 00:00:26.475
"I'll be back soon, Miss Apricot.

5
00:00:26.476 --> 00:00:31.707
Um, Principal Penn needs help in the library!"

6
00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:38.682
Terrell scratched his head. "Roxy is always running off somewhere."

7
00:00:38.683 --> 00:00:44.252
Miss Apricot looked up. "Shh!"

8
00:00:44.253 --> 00:00:47.806
Roxy ran down the hall and out the front door.

9
00:00:47.807 --> 00:00:53.104
She shot into the air. Zoom!

10
00:00:53.105 --> 00:00:56.441
Roxy arrived at Metro City Plumbing Supply.

11
00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:58.835
Detective Smith was in an office.

12
00:00:58.836 --> 00:01:01.850
He sat on the edge of the desk.

13
00:01:01.851 --> 00:01:05.356
A cute little baby snuggled in his arms.

14
00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:07.693
"Hi, Detective," Roxy said.

15
00:01:07.694 --> 00:01:11.317
"Did you get a new job as a babysitter?"

16
00:01:11.318 --> 00:01:14.792
"Ha-ha." Detective Smith frowned.

17
00:01:14.793 --> 00:01:20.362
"I'm not babysitting, Rocket Girl. Somebody left this—ouch!"

18
00:01:20.363 --> 00:01:23.450
The baby was pulling on the detective's ear.

19
00:01:23.451 --> 00:01:26.174
"Somebody left this baby here."

20
00:01:26.175 --> 00:01:34.152
Roxy looked closely at Detective Smith. "You look different—younger."

21
00:01:34.153 --> 00:01:37.900
Detective Smith chuckled. "Thanks for noticing.

22
00:01:37.901 --> 00:01:40.901
I got a new treatment at Vanda's Day Spa.

23
00:01:40.902 --> 00:01:45.289
Vanda said it would take years off my life."

24
00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:48.958
Detective Smith cleared his throat.

25
00:01:48.959 --> 00:01:53.719
"But we have more important things to discuss now, Rocket Girl."

26
00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:58.305
Roxy nodded. "This baby looks familiar."

27
00:01:58.306 --> 00:02:02.544
The baby smiled and clapped. "Da-da! Goo!"

28
00:02:02.545 --> 00:02:09.133
Roxy giggled. "Aww! He's so cute!"

29
00:02:09.134 --> 00:02:12.613
"Yes, he's very cute," Detective Smith said.

30
00:02:12.614 --> 00:02:15.627
"But we still have a mystery to solve."

31
00:02:15.628 --> 00:02:19.498
"Right!" Roxy looked around the office.

32
00:02:19.499 --> 00:02:21.380
There wasn't much in it.

33
00:02:21.381 --> 00:02:26.881
It had a desk, a chair, a shelf with binders, and a small safe.

34
00:02:26.882 --> 00:02:30.350
"Did anyone see Mr. Copper leave?"

35
00:02:30.351 --> 00:02:33.414
"I don't think so," Detective Smith said.

36
00:02:33.415 --> 00:02:39.200
"There was no one else here when I arrived."

37
00:02:39.201 --> 00:02:45.133
Just then the office door flew open, and a woman stepped in.

38
00:02:45.134 --> 00:02:47.719
"What's going on in here?"

39
00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:51.101
"Mr. Copper disappeared," Detective Smith said.

40
00:02:51.102 --> 00:02:53.090
"Do you know him?"

41
00:02:53.091 --> 00:02:58.678
The woman folded her arms. "Of course I do. He's my father.

42
00:02:58.679 --> 00:03:02.973
He went on vacation. Now can you please leave?

43
00:03:02.974 --> 00:03:08.430
I have important work to do."

44
00:03:08.431 --> 00:03:12.169
Roxy and Detective Smith went outside.

45
00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:15.487
Right away Roxy gasped.

46
00:03:15.488 --> 00:03:18.563
Babies crawled along the sidewalk.

47
00:03:18.564 --> 00:03:22.713
"Where did my husband go?" a woman shouted.

48
00:03:22.714 --> 00:03:27.417
"And why is that baby wearing his tie?"

49
00:03:27.418 --> 00:03:31.937
"People are turning into babies!" Detective Smith said.

50
00:03:31.938 --> 00:03:36.046
"Ba-ba-ba!" The baby in his arms sang and drooled.

51
00:03:36.047 --> 00:03:42.677
Roxy gasped again. "This baby looks just like Mr. Copper.

52
00:03:42.678 --> 00:03:45.524
I think it is him!"

53
00:03:45.525 --> 00:03:49.655
"What about that woman in the office?" Detective Smith asked.

54
00:03:49.656 --> 00:03:54.587
"Was it really Mr. Copper's daughter?"

55
00:03:54.588 --> 00:03:56.999
Roxy rushed back into the office.

56
00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:04.198
The woman was gone, and the safe was empty!
